# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages — all routes serve index.html.
# Bare /admin and the no-trailing-slash /admin/orders + /admin/books are
# pre-empted by (a) the pages.dev platform redirecting /admin to / once
# Functions are used, and (b) stale edge-cached HTML from the project's
# original Next.js deployment. Explicit 301 redirects are served from the
# rules layer and bypass that stale cache, so each affected path is
# redirected to its trailing-slash variant.
/admin /admin/ 301
/admin/orders /admin/orders/ 301
/admin/books /admin/books/ 301
/admin/ /index.html 200
/admin/* /index.html 200
/* /index.html 200
